        "bookId": 64,
        "chapterId": 402,
        "headingId": 764,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>MITF pathway&ndash;activated melanocytic tumours are clear cell tumours with melanocytic differentiation and an ACT::<em>MITF</em> or <em>MITF</em>::<em>CREM</em> translocation.</p>\r\n",
