        "pkcontributionId": 124938,
        "bookId": 64,
        "chapterId": 402,
        "headingId": 779,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p><em>Essential:</em> a dermal neoplasm of clear cells expressing melanocytic differentiation; evidence of <em>MITF</em> translocation.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2025-04-24T16:44:53"
      }
    ],
